timeline
    title DeFi protocol milestones, 2017 to 2026
    section Primitives
        2017-06 : Bancor ships the first on-chain automated market maker
        2017-12 : MakerDAO launches single-collateral Dai, the first overcollateralised on-chain loan
        2018-06 : Marble Protocol ships the first flash loan
        2018-09 : Compound v1 opens the first pooled money market
        2018-11 : Uniswap v1 deploys with x*y=k and a 0.30% fee
    section Money legos
        2019-05 : Compound v2 introduces cTokens and pooled money markets
        2019-11 : Compound adds the kinked jump rate model in JumpRateModel.sol
        2020-01 : Aave ships the flash loan and makes it a product
        2020-02 : Curve launches StableSwap with the amplified invariant
        2020-03-12 : Black Thursday, zero-bid auctions leave MakerDAO 5.67M DAI short
        2020-05 : Uniswap v2 adds the cumulative-price TWAP oracle and flash swaps
        2020-06-15 : Compound starts distributing COMP, inventing yield farming
        2020-08 : SushiSwap vampire-attacks Uniswap with SUSHI emissions
        2020-09-16 : UNI airdrops 400 tokens to every past caller
    section Capital efficiency
        2021-05-05 : Uniswap v3 ships concentrated liquidity and tick-based positions
        2021-10-27 : Cream loses 130M USD to a vault share-price oracle
        2022-03 : Aave v3 adds isolation mode, e-mode, supply caps and the portal
        2022-04-17 : Beanstalk loses 181M USD to flash-loaned governance votes
        2022-08 : Compound v3 (Comet) replaces the multi-asset pool with a single borrowable asset
    section Consolidation
        2023-03-13 : Euler loses 197M USD to a donation attack
        2023-07-30 : A Vyper compiler bug disables reentrancy locks on Curve pools
        2024-01 : Morpho Blue makes lending markets permissionless and immutable
        2025-01-31 : Uniswap v4 ships the singleton PoolManager, hooks and flash accounting
    section Fees return
        2025-05-22 : Cetus loses 223M USD to an unchecked shift overflow
        2025-11-03 : Balancer v2 loses 128M USD to a rounding direction
        2025-12 : UNIfication turns on Uniswap protocol fees and burns UNI
        2026-03-30 : Aave v4 goes live with a hub-and-spoke liquidity model
